{"availability":"available","full":"eleron96/motio","name":"motio","description":"People-first team planner: tasks, projects and workload on one shared timeline. Free hosted app with a no-signup live demo. Open source (AGPL-3.0), self-hostable.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-01-16T09:40:53Z","updated":"2026-09-21T15:47:03Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://motio.nikog.net","topics":["capacity-planning","keycloak","open-source","project-management","pwa","react","resource-planning","self-hosted","supabase","task-management","team-planning","timeline","typescript","workload"],"demo":"https://motio.nikog.net/demo?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.354Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.354Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.354Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.354Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One shared timeline for your whole team: people, projects and workload on a single screen. Free and open source: use the hosted app, or run it on your own servers. The live demo needs no sign-up.","▶ Try the live demo · Open Motio · Self-host it · What's new","Recorded in the live demo. Click it to try the same yourself — no sign-up."],"features":["👥 People first, not tasks first. Every row is a person, every bar is their work — across all projects at once. Elsewhere that is one view among many; in Motio it is the product.","🔥 Overload shows up before the deadline does. Workload sits on the same timeline and in a department heatmap, so you see who is full without assembling a report from boards, filters and spreadsheets.","⚡ Any task in 10 seconds. Click, type, drag. No custom fields, no automations, no kanban mode — that is a position, not a missing feature. The manifesto (in Russian) explains why.","📅 Timeline — drag-and-drop planner grouped by people or by project, with day / week / calendar views; milestones and time off sit on the same grid. Drag a task past the edge of the screen and the timeline scrolls along.","✅ Tasks with depth — subtasks, repeating series, priorities, tags, rich descriptions with pasted images, comments with @mentions and screenshots."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"94f75f8eda2904792d7854a50715301fbf01a500d88dbaad89ef64781434e9de","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.502Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:48.502Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One shared timeline for your whole team: people, projects and workload on a single screen. Free and open source: use the hosted app, or run it on your own servers. The live demo needs no sign-up.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"▶ Try the live demo · Open Motio · Self-host it · What's new","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Why Motio · Features · Self-host · Architecture · Documentation","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🔐 SSO out of the box — sign-in through Keycloak; sign-up is self-service (the app opens the Keycloak registration form), while invitations and account deletion happen in the app itself, Keycloak is the identity store.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"🧪 Demo sandbox — /demo runs entirely in the browser on sample data, no sign-in needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"94f75f8eda2904792d7854a50715301fbf01a500d88dbaad89ef64781434e9de","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eleron96/motio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39: